		    "s, flaps) where the base aero data only\nhas CX, CZ, and Cm. Input should be a 6 element vector of the aero\ncoe"
		    "fficients [CZ CY CZ Cl Cm Cn].\n\nCl = Cl_input + arm*CZ_input\nCn = Cn_input + arm*CX_input"
		    Initialization	    "Kc = eye(6);\n\nKc(4,3) = arm; % Cl = Cl + arm*CZ\nKc(6,1) = -arm; % Cn = Cn - arm*CX"
